    "longDescription": "The best app for keeping track of your books that is free, open source, with no ads and no tracking!\n\nOpenreads is a reading list app that will help you organize your library with three lists provided:\n- books you finished,\n- books you are currently reading,\n- books you want to read later.\n\nYou can add the books by searching them up in Open Library, scanning their barcode or by entering the book's details manually.\n\nYou can also see come cool statistics!",
